Hello,

   My thanks to everyone who helped me out with this problem. The problem
turned out to be with the MDR and not with the alpha machines.
What happened is that a relatively new MDR (only a couple months old) that
we got shipped had very old firmware. (version 1100). Apparently,
this version of the firmware is not compatible with how Tru64 version 5 and
newer. The older firmware has SCCmode off by default and has no way to
control or set this mode. Once I updated the firmware and set the mode to
on, voila, all of the tape devices showed up.

Thanks again for your help.

