Here is the answer send by Thomas P. Blinn.

NHD3 was a nightmare.  The "osf_boot" in the original V4.0F kit was
bad, and causes boot errors.  There is an "osf_boot" in the root of
the NHD3 CDROM.  Copy it into the root directory of your system and
then the boot link SHOULD work.


