Thanks to all who responded.  I'm new to this community and never 
expected this level of response.

My problem of "too many users logged in" when trying to connect was 
linked to a bug in OpenSSH 3.4.p1.  The fix was to add "#define 
BROKEN_FD_PASSING" to the config.h file--after having run configure and 
prior to running make install.  Thanks to Steven Dowdy for pointing this 
out.

In the end, there were no licensing issues involved.  I must say I'm 
much more intimate with lmf after this.

Eric Zylstra



