A number of people responded and, as usual, a more careful reading of the
manual would have answered the question.  Under CMSO SETUP hit F6 to go to
Advanced.  Whereas Down Arrow worked in previous menus, this requires TAB
to move down to where you are offreed to Select SRM for VMS or Tru64.

Apparently it is important to Power cycle in order to update the ROM (not
sure about this however) so that upon rebooting you won't have to go through
the same process each time.  This seems to work unless you wait to long.  I
had
shut the system down for about a day, and when powereing backup, had to go
throught
the same process again.

Thanks to  Uwe Lienig, Joe.Carrico and Klaus.Schneider, who also emailed me
the
relevant manuals.
