Hi,

  My question: How should I compile a fortran program, that uses the IMSL 
library, under tru64 unix? (my mistake was thought that the fortran for 
tru64 unix included an IMSL library inside)
 
  The answer: You should have installed an IMSL library implementation to 
link your program with. I thought that an IMSL implementation was included 
on the tru64 unix fortran distribution, but it is not true. 

  Another question: Is there a free IMSL library implementation for tru64 
unix?

